{"version":1,"content":"<p>從讓人停不下來的短視頻，到藉助情感互動留住用户的AI聊天機械人，科技公司爭奪用户時間的產品設計，正成為歐盟新一輪監管的焦點。綜合多家媒體周一報道，他們看到的<strong>《數字公平法案》（Digital Fairness Act）</strong>草案顯示，<strong>歐盟委員會擬要求企業允許用户關閉誘導強迫性或過度使用的功能，並將利用模擬人際關係延長互動的AI系統納入監管。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585752.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.115420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:42:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"a53dbffba782aaadc8266848158b0af59335fbfc90aa26d43ddbf076b0c7d262","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}